 Harrison County has 75 years on record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 188% of normal in June to July and 45% in January to February. So far in 2026 February to March came in at 42% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 26236 had its driest year in 1976 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
